Fire a powerful beam of stone-shattering force, digging out any walls in its path up to [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] range.

The beam continues to a range of 10, affecting any creatures in its path, dealing [140, 188, 226, 258, 286 (TL1-5; SP 100)] physical damage to them.

If any walls are dug, you gain [15%, 20%, 23%, 27%, 30% (TL1-5)] physical damage bonus for 6 turns.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
